      "content": "i know there's help, but help can't fix my brain. it's just changing. i feel like i'm watching a movie of my life and the person on screen is becoming a stranger. i don't want to be that person. i don't want to reach a point where i'm just a burden to everyone because i can't even tie my own shoes or hold a conversation. it feels like i'm losing my dignity bit by bit every single day.",
